    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a quiet room. Four doors surround you. One will lead you deeper. One might lead you out. But <strong>where is The Fifth Door?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fifth Door is a <strong>short walking simulator</strong> inspired by Silent Hill, Amnesia, and Resident Evil, and the claustrophobic tension of films like The Cube and The Grudge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you enjoy games like</strong> Observation Duty, The Exit 8, Slender, or Fatal Frame, you\u2019ll feel right at home here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dreamlike space filled with over <strong>36 unique puzzles</strong> with surprising variations. Something is always changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for a single-session experience: <strong>playable in 30\u201360 minutes.</strong></p>More content unlocks when you find The 5th door for about <strong>2+ hours of gameplay total</strong> ",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a quiet room. Four doors surround you. One will lead you deeper. One might lead you out. But <strong>where is The Fifth Door?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fifth Door is a <strong>short walking simulator</strong> inspired by Silent Hill, Amnesia, and Resident Evil, and the claustrophobic tension of films like The Cube and The Grudge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you enjoy games like</strong> Observation Duty, The Exit 8, Slender, or Fatal Frame, you\u2019ll feel right at home here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dreamlike space filled with over <strong>36 unique puzzles</strong> with surprising variations. Something is always changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for a single-session experience: <strong>playable in 30\u201360 minutes.</strong></p>More content unlocks when you find The 5th door for about <strong>2+ hours of gameplay total</strong> ",
    "short_description": "You find yourself in a quiet room with four doors. There's ALWAYS an anomaly. Choose wisely.",
